search?q=Deep+Narratives+%26+NAAK+Wushi", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Deep+Narratives+%26+NAAK+Wushi", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Deep+Narratives+%26+NAAK+Wushi", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Deep+Narratives+%26+NAAK+Wushi", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/1736785482", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Deep+Narratives+%26+NAAK+Wushi", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Deep+Narratives+%26+NAAK+Wushi&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2024 Narratives Records / EMPIRE"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 14, "low": 8}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:09:16", "end": "00:09:33", "text": "You are tuning in to The Arnold Show on FBi Radio 94.5 with myself, DJ TeeSoul. I hope you're all well, having a good weekend, enjoying the weather while we still have it as good as this right now."}, {"start": "00:35:32", "end": "00:37:25", "text": "You are tuned in to The Arnold Show on FBi Radio 94.5 and we are just about halfway through this week's show again somehow. Don't know how we ended up here but I actually had a question while I was playing and I was thinking about the experience of a consumer of music when a DJ is playing and what that looks like for different people in terms of what they want to listen to what they want to hear and as I was playing I was thinking okay some of these songs very mainstream most people that are even remotely or have like an idea of you know I'm a piano would know these songs very big on socials and then there's music that I find that I play that is a little bit different probably not as mainstream which personally i like i think having that balance is really important just as a dj in general and someone who is trying to share new music that's the goal at the end of the day but then also playing music i know people would know kind of keep them interested in things like that but i wanted to know what you guys thought of maybe being a consumer of the music not necessarily being a dj or even being a dj if you're listening in what's your opinion what do you think how important is the balance do you care what music you're listening to as long as the mixing is good and i think especially in this in this genre on this space in this world of music the mixing is just as important as the music to me but i think the balance is also very important but i want to know what you think send me a text on 0435 123 945 and let me know what you think"}, {"start": "00:55:50", "end": "00:57:34", "text": "You are tuned into The Honour Show on FBi Radio 94.5 and just before I love and leave everyone, just wanted to share a little something sweet that just came through the text line from Anika and she said that she really sinks into the flow when she can trust the DJ selection and mixing. this is in response to the last question that I asked everybody about how they sort of interact with music as a consumer whether you're a DJ just a listener and how you feel about new music old music and how it kind of flows throughout a DJ set then she continued to say I can tell very quickly if the DJ has deep respect for the music they are playing and I really love that part of what she said because you can definitely tell a dj an artist who really sort of understands and has a really like a lot of knowledge as to how they play and what they play specifically and i really appreciate that there are people like anika in this universe that do see that because it is probably one of the best things as a dj producer artist that you could hear from somebody else but i thought i'd share that lovely message just to end out our saturday together and somehow i've ended up in three step i do it all the time don't know why i keep saying somehow we know what's gonna happen every week but i really hope everyone had a great hour with me i'll be back same time same place for all the same vibes this time next week saturday if there's anything you want to let me know send me a text on 0435 123 945 this was the ano show"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Can't Get Enough", "artists": [{"name": "LA Priest"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:01:00"}, "track": {"title": "Ilanga (feat. Kelvin Momo, Baby S.O.N, Zādok & Mas Musiq)", "artists": [{"name": "Riky Rick"}, {"name": "Tyler ICU & Young Stunna"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:02:00"}, "track": {"title": "This Dance (feat. Kabza De Small & MDU aka TRP)", "artists": [{"name": "Tycoon"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:04:00"}, "track": {"title": "Manca", "artists": [{"name": "Felo Le Tee & Toss"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:00"}, "track": {"title": "Definition of Bambo", "artists": [{"name": "Theodesoul & Ndibo Ndibs"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:10:50"}, "track": {"title": "Ncono Sishade", "artists": [{"name": "JayJayy"}, {"name": "DJ Tshegu & Quinton Deep"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:15:00"}, "track": {"title": "Ngimbonile (feat. De Rose)", "artists": [{"name": "Tycoon & Babalwa M"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:18:00"}, "track": {"title": "Da Capo Feel (feat. Lastborn)", "artists": [{"name": "Culprit 001 & Bandros"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:20:46"}, "track": {"title": "My House (feat. Tman Xpress